  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening social protection and employment systems in response to green and demographic transitions in VN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of a Join-Programme on Strengthening social protection and employment systems in response to green and demographic transitions In Viet Nam, the initiation plan is developed for UNDP&#x2019;s interventions in this Joint Programme (JP). The JP aims to support the strengthening of the social protection system and access to productive employment opportunities in response to rapid population aging and green transition for all women and men.</narrative>
